---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on the original 2013 Bukkit plugin
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT terms above cover the NeoForge mod: everything under
`src/main/`, together with the build files and documentation.

The tree under `src/me/sablednah/` is the original 2013 Bukkit/Spigot plugin,
kept in place only as a reference while the port is written. It shares no
code with the mod above and is NOT covered by the MIT grant. It was
originally distributed under Creative Commons BY-NC-ND, and parts of it
derive from other people's work (the README credits DarkLust's DaySpawner
and BlockBreaker code, and some utility classes appear to have come from
other plugins), so those parts remain under whatever terms their authors
granted.

That directory will be removed when the port is released, at which point
this note becomes redundant and the MIT grant covers the whole repository.
The original plugin will remain in the git history.
